# --- Go build artifacts ---
*.exe
*.exe~
*.dll
*.so
*.dylib
*.test
*.out
/app/app
/app/bin/

# --- Go test / coverage / profiling output ---
coverage.out
coverage.html
*.cover
*.prof

# --- Go workspace files (we use go.mod only) ---
go.work
go.work.sum

# --- Submission artifact (generated by `make zip`) ---
team*.zip

# --- Submission metadata (academic info — local only, never push) ---
# Contains team number + student IDs that the Phase 15 `make zip` target
# injects into the staged README. A committed `submission.txt.example`
# template documents the format.
submission.txt

# --- Environment files (never commit secrets) ---
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

# --- macOS / Windows / Linux junk ---
.DS_Store
.AppleDouble
.LSOverride
Thumbs.db
ehthumbs.db
Desktop.ini
$RECYCLE.BIN/

# --- IDE / editor scratch ---
.idea/
.vscode/
*.swp
*.swo
*~

# --- Logs ---
*.log

# --- Local-only Claude handoff context (not for public repo) ---
CLAUDE.md
